;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;release(P2,epoch) / receipt(P2,실제 전달 범위)&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17.333333;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1749.333333" y="1103.333333" width="712.0" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n264" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1401.333333" y="1120.0" width="313.333333" height="29.333333" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n265" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;u2 입력 / Text / Voice 실제 전달&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17.333333;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1404.0" y="1121.666667" width="308.0" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n269" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2148.0" y="1213.333333" width="229.76" height="29.333333" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n270" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;K1 전송 / 외부 접수 확인&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17.333333;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2150.666667" y="1215.0" width="326.666667" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n271" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1401.333333" y="1213.333333" width="282.026667" height="27.333333" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n272" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.2;&quot;&gt;로컬 VAD / 발화 종료 ≠ 전사 완료&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16.0;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1404.0" y="1215.0" width="313.333333" height="24.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n273" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;u2: 답변 입력 / R2: 답변 요청 / Q1: 보고서 질문 / T1: 업무 / X1: 외부 실행 / P1·P2: 게시 / K1: 명령&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=26.666667;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="53.333333" y="1312.0" width="2453.333333" height="34.666667" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n274" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;육각형: 외부 모델·Agent / 내부 접수 ≠ 외부 접수 / B: hold 요청 ≠ 업무 gate 적용 / 세부 프로토콜은 본문 §4.2&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=24.0;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="53.333333" y="1358.666667" width="2453.333333" height="31.2" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
